- Say that again, slowly. 

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:15.175
- Saquon Rasul Quevis Barkley.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:22.115
Rasul means “one sent,” and Quevis is a name 
that my mom and my aunt kinda came up 
with when they thought of a cute boy name. 

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:27.787
