which I think was pretty cool. 

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:05.725
So when she came out, we knew the name. 

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:10.230
We kinda set on, Amari was gonna be a boy, 
and Jada was gonna be a girl

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:13.166
When she pushed out that baby, we said, “Jada.” 

